      "text": "i can tell exactly how your week is going based on your browser tab count.",
      "posted_at": 1784345498.2551115,
      "views": 11,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784941674.7093925
    },
    {
      "id": "18113664869289660",
      "text": "people who re-watch the same show ten times are the only people at peace.",
      "posted_at": 1784359583.924335,
      "views": 183,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 1,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784953485.6459837
    },
    {
      "id": "17879189850615725",
      "text": "sitting in the dark with no fan or music is my actual therapy.",
      "posted_at": 1784371169.5622723,
      "views": 99,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784953485.6459837
    },
    {
      "id": "18097043153257070",
      "text": "why do we feel the need to say 'you too' when the waiter says 'enjoy your meal'?",
      "posted_at": 1784383592.3890479,
      "views": 238,
      "replies": 9,
      "likes": 5,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784953485.6459837
    },
    {
      "id": "17909362932441331",
      "text": "maggie is better when it's slightly soupy.\n\ndry maggie is just sad, salty cardboard.",
      "posted_at": 1784394717.3530056,
      "views": 106,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 1,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784953485.6459837
    },
    {
      "id": "18037065332813220",
      "text": "people who use light mode on their phone apps actually enjoy eye pain.",
