      "views": 164,
      "replies": 3,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784953485.6459837
    },
    {
      "id": "18108994387797823",
      "text": "does anyone else feel physically assaulted when someone calls instead of texting?",
      "posted_at": 1784469132.865588,
      "views": 148,
      "replies": 3,
      "likes": 7,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784953485.6459837
    },
    {
      "id": "17897631102484546",
      "text": "people who keep their unread notification count in the thousands are absolute sociopaths.",
      "posted_at": 1784482799.284841,
      "views": 55,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 3,
      "reposts": 1,
      "last_fetched": 1784953485.6459837
    },
    {
      "id": "18097940720168293",
      "text": "i\u2019m convinced the \u2018seen\u2019 receipt was created purely to ruin human relationships.",
      "posted_at": 1784523043.9179544,
      "views": 68,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784953485.6459837
    },
    {
      "id": "17926478676367381",
      "text": "water should not have a temperature. \n\nit\u2019s either room temp or it\u2019s wrong.",
      "posted_at": 1784533882.1245456,
      "views": 191,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784953485.6459837
    },
    {
      "id": "18096341354458150",
      "text": "the best part of the day is when you finally take off your watch and sit down.",
      "posted_at": 1784543985.1195524,
      "views": 275,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784953485.6459837
    },
    {
      "id": "18118748008890638",
